WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.900 --> 00:00:07.820
You need an old fuzzy sock, long pants, closed shoes, tweezers, and a hand lens.

2
00:00:08.883 --> 00:00:10.463
Pull the sock over one shoe.

3
00:00:11.303 --> 00:00:14.823
Walk slowly along the edge of a weedy patch for three to five minutes.

4
00:00:15.643 --> 00:00:20.043
Staying outdoors, an adult uses tweezers to pull off what stuck, and looks for

5
00:00:20.043 --> 00:00:21.923
ticks. Count the seeds.

6
00:00:22.967 --> 00:00:25.907
Look for the hooks, spines, or barbs that held on.

7
00:00:26.707 --> 00:00:30.707
Then sort the seeds into four piles: flies, floats, sticks, gets eaten.

8
00:00:31.667 --> 00:00:33.847
Some seeds fit two piles, and that is fine.

9
00:00:34.787 --> 00:00:38.027
Drop one of each kind in water, and check again after ten minutes.

10
00:00:39.050 --> 00:00:40.870
Stay within arm's reach outdoors.

11
00:00:40.870 --> 00:00:43.470
Never eat wild berries or seeds.
